---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/common/Container.astro';
import Button from '../components/common/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Product Overview — Atlas OS Business Operating System"
  description="Explore the architecture, core modules, and financial integrity of Atlas OS. Discover how Atlas OS unifies inventory, sales orders, GST invoices, and accounts receivable."
>
  {/* HERO */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-radial-glow border-b border-border/50">
    <Container size="default">
      <div data-enter class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-brand-50 text-brand-800 border border-brand-200">
          Architecture & Capabilities
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold font-heading tracking-tight text-content-primary">
          Manage <span class="text-gradient">stock, sales, and payments</span> together
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Run everyday retail and wholesale work from one catalog, with permission controls for sales, stock, and finance teams.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  {/* ARCHITECTURAL PILLARS */}
  <section class="py-18 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-border">
    <Container size="default">
      <div data-reveal-group class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Pillar 1: Mint -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-mint-200 bg-mint-50/30 hover:bg-white hover:border-mint-300 transition-all duration-200 space-y-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-mint-100 text-mint-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg font-heading">
            01
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-content-primary">Operational Core</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Fast catalog search across tens of thousands of electrical and hardware SKUs. Multi-UOM packaging logic (Coils,
            Bundles, Meters, Nos) ensures physical yard counts and digital orders remain synchronized.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs pt-3 border-t border-mint-200/80">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mint-600"></span>
              <span>Available vs. Committed stock validation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mint-600"></span>
              <span>Commercial sales order conversion</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mint-600"></span>
              <span>Audited manual stock adjustments</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2: Sky -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50/30 hover:bg-white hover:border-sky-300 transition-all duration-200 space-y-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg font-heading">
            02
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-content-primary">Financial Engine</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Statutory GST invoicing with immutable rate snapshots. Customer credit limits prevent unauthorized sales, while
            payment allocations resolve multi-invoice RTGS and NEFT bank settlements accurately.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs pt-3 border-t border-sky-200/80">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600"></span>
              <span>Interstate IGST vs. CGST+SGST logic</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600"></span>
              <span>Real-time debtor receivables ledger</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-600"></span>
              <span>Cross-period settlement tracking</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3: Lavender -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-lavender-200 bg-lavender-50/30 hover:bg-white hover:border-lavender-300 transition-all duration-200 space-y-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-lavender-100 text-lavender-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg font-heading">
            03
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-content-primary">Reporting & Governance</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
            One-click Microsoft Excel export engine generating complete 5-sheet statutory workbooks for any Indian FY.
            Enforced by PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) across 6 granular role levels.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs pt-3 border-t border-lavender-200/80">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-lavender-600"></span>
              <span>15-Year statutory FY selector (Apr 1–Mar 31)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-lavender-600"></span>
              <span>Revenue vs. non-revenue segregation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-content-primary font-medium">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-lavender-600"></span>
              <span>Zero client data leakage across tenants</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  {/* COMPARISON TABLE: ATLAS OS VS LEGACY ACCOUNTING */}
  <section class="py-18 md:py-24 bg-surface-secondary border-b border-border">
    <Container size="default">
      <div data-reveal class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-14">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-brand-50 text-brand-800 border border-brand-200">
          The Modern Difference
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-content-primary">
          Atlas OS vs. Traditional Accounting Software
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
          How Atlas OS compares to legacy desktop accounting packages widely used across India.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-surface-secondary border-b border-border text-content-primary font-heading uppercase tracking-wider">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-6 py-4">Capability & Workflow</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-brand-800 font-extrabold bg-brand-50/60">Atlas OS (Modern Cloud ERP)</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">Legacy Accounting (BUSY / Tally Style)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">Physical UOM Handling</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                Native Coils, Bundles, Meters, Boxes, Nos built into item master.
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Complex alternate-unit setups often resulting in decimal rounding mismatch.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">Contractor Credit Verification</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                Automatic pre-flight check blocks confirmation when limit is breached.
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Passive warnings that billing staff easily bypass with a keyboard tap.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">Multi-Invoice Payment Matching</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                Interactive settlement allocations with cross-period reference resolution.
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Manual voucher adjustment screens requiring tedious voucher number entry.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">Multi-Organization Branches</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                Instant branch switching with cryptographic Row Level Security (RLS).
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Separate local data files requiring manual backup, restore, and file sharing.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">Audit-Ready Excel Exports</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                One-click 5-sheet workbook formatted specifically for chartered accountants.
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Raw CSV/TSV dumps requiring extensive manual Excel cleanup before audit.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-content-primary">User Permissions & Roles</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand-900 bg-brand-50/20">
                6 granular role levels (Owner, Admin, Sales, Inventory, Accounts, Viewer).
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-content-secondary">
                Basic password locks with weak file-level security vulnerable to tampering.
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  {/* CTA */}
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <Container size="default">
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-brand-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50 to-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-content-primary">See Atlas OS in Action</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary max-w-xl">
            Book a 20-minute product demonstration customized to your wholesale product catalog, tax structure, and billing workflow.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
          <Button href="/request-demo" variant="primary" size="md" class="font-semibold">
            <span>Request Demo</span>
          </Button>
          <Button href="/features" variant="outline" size="md" class="font-semibold">
            <span>Browse Features</span>
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
